Here is a complete HTML and CSS landing page for a fictional space tourism company:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Stellar Voyages - Space Tourism</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background: #0a0a2e; color: #e0e0e0; min-height: 100vh; }
        .stars { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom, #1b2735 0%, #090a0f 100%); z-index: -1; }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        header { text-align: center; padding: 60px 0 40px; }
        header h1 { font-size: 3.5em; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4ff, #7b2ff7, #ff00ff); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
        header p { color: #888; font-size: 1.2em; margin-top: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        nav { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; }
        nav a { color: #00d4ff; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 20px; font-size: 1.1em; transition: color 0.3s; }
        nav a:hover { color: #ff00ff; }
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 80px 0; }
        .hero h2 { font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .hero p { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 30px; line-height: 1.8; color: #ccc; }
        .cta-button { display: inline-block; padding: 16px 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4ff, #7b2ff7); color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; }
        .destinations { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; padding: 40px 0; }
        .card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 15px; padding: 30px; text-align: center; transition: transform 0.3s; }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); border-color: #7b2ff7; }
        .card h3 { color: #00d4ff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .card .price { color: #ff00ff; font-size: 1.5em; margin: 15px 0; }
        .card p { color: #aaa; line-height: 1.5; }
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 30px; color: #555; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { header h1 { font-size: 2em; } .hero h2 { font-size: 1.8em; } .destinations { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="stars"></div>
    <header><h1>Stellar Voyages</h1><p>YOUR JOURNEY TO THE STARS BEGINS HERE</p></header>
    <nav>
        <a href="#">Destinations</a>
        <a href="#">Experience</a>
        <a href="#">Book Now</a>
        <a href="#">About</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="container">
        <section class="hero">
            <h2>Experience the Final Frontier</h2>
            <p>From orbital hotels to lunar resorts, humanity's greatest adventure awaits. Join us for the journey of a lifetime aboard our state-of-the-art spacecraft.</p>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">Book Your Flight</a>
        </section>
        <section class="destinations">
            <div class="card"><h3>Low Earth Orbit</h3><div class="price">$250,000</div><p>3 days in orbit with 360-degree views of Earth from our luxury habitat.</p></div>
            <div class="card"><h3>Lunar Gateway</h3><div class="price">$1.5M</div><p>7 days at the Moon with surface excursions and Earth-rise views.</p></div>
            <div class="card"><h3>Mars Express</h3><div class="price">$5M</div><p>30-day expedition to the Red Planet with full training included.</p></div>
        </section>
    </div>
    <footer><p>&copy; 2025 Stellar Voyages. The future is waiting.</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
```
